Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:04:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add HexaTech Time Planner's packages (module plans)

HexaTech Time Planner sold on its own like HexaTech CRM (owner 2026-11-09): the product time_planner and 39 hidden,
unpriced plans - time_lite, time, time_pro (49, 85, 149 EUR a month, 15 % less yearly) and the Time Planner with
Appointments, Loyalty, Content or CRM in every pair of packages at the sum of the two. Every package carries
time_management (the Enterprise plan's switch, which the loyalty application's planner is behind); they differ by team
(3, 10, 25) and the monthly AI allowance (5, 15, 40 USD; two products' allowances add up). Mirrors
App\Support\PlanModules in the loyalty application; a plan already sold is left as it is. Sell them with
php artisan stripe:sync --module-plans --publish. ModulePlansTest counts 105 module plans.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AxwcUt75bwsMd1PRtpF7UJ
